msgid ":ref:`平均二乗変位<mean-squared-displacement>`\\ から、物理時間を持つ軌跡の拡散係数を求める。"
msgstr ""
"Use the :ref:`mean squared displacement <mean-squared-displacement>`\\  to obtain the diffusion "
"coefficient from trajectories with a physical time scale."

#: ../../md/thermal_activation.rst:308
msgid ""
"`大規模モデルのLi拡散係数 <https://example.quloud-platform.quemix.com/li3po4/large-model-"
"diffusivity.html>`__ は、縦軸に拡散係数の常用対数を使い、薄膜実験の活性化エネルギーと比較する。"
msgstr ""
"`Li Diffusion Coefficient in the Large Model <https://example.quloud-platform.quemix.com/li3po4"
"/large-model-diffusivity.html>`__ uses the base-10 logarithm of the diffusion coefficient on the "
"vertical axis and compares the activation energy with thin-film experiments."

